#==============================================================================================
#
#   counter_style_2 - CounterStyle: counter representations
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/CounterStyle.cpp lines 199-694:
#       generate_an_initial_representation_for_the_counter_value (each system, the
#       extended CJK tables), uses_a_negative_sign and generate a counter representation.
#       Where the C++ mixes an i64 counter value with a size_t symbol count, the arithmetic
#       is unsigned as in C++ (`(value - 1) % size()`).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2026, Callum Law <callumlaw1709@outlook.com>.
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
